{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，S11只有22秒，Y连续四层话与感受交替，视线切换略费劲，不如X左栏顺着读来得直接。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把关键转折和人物动机放大高亮，感受又随音乐分时出现，观众不用在X的大堆短词里寻找对应关系，更容易一眼抓住每段要点。它不仅让人知道他在怀念、抗拒或害怕，还通过具体的音乐变化和身体感受，让人明白情绪为什么这样转变。尤其从害怕孤单、怀疑离开，到承认两种经历都真实、决定继续生活，Y把前后串成了一条清楚又有细节的心理轨迹，而不是一连串相近的情绪标签。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "91347c1a-79b5-4198-9318-a05bac9656e6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T031033953922Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:11:17.581777+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d628bef414392540355832136ded571b24bfae56e03a49078441d9d276f64ae5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee53